.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-formula=chen|leroy|both
Sound speed formula of the profiles: Chen and Millero, Leroy, or one file for each.
Default: chen.
.TP
.B \-\-help {\-H}
Print a short description and the usage, and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-input=\fIfile\fP {\-I\fIfile\fP}
Site or route file, told apart by its header line and then by its suffix.
\fB\-\-sites\fP and \fB\-\-route\fP give the same file and state the type. Required.
.TP
.B \-\-outputfolder=\fIdirectory\fP {\-O\fIdirectory\fP}
Directory of the output, made if necessary. Required.
.TP
.B \-\-overwrite
Replace existing profile files. Without it, a position whose file exists fails.
.TP
.B \-\-period=\fIperiod\fP {\-P\fIperiod\fP}
Climatological period of the grid, such as decav, A5B7 or B5C2. Required.
.TP
.B \-\-resolution=01|04 {\-R01|04}
Grid resolution: 01 is 1 degree, 04 is 0.25 degree. Required.
.TP
.B \-\-route=\fIfile\fP
Route file. See \fB\-\-input\fP.
.TP
.B \-\-sites=\fIfile\fP
Site file. See \fB\-\-input\fP.
.TP
.B \-\-strict-nearest
Use only the nearest grid cell.
.TP
.B \-\-svpfolder=\fIdirectory\fP {\-S\fIdirectory\fP}
Directory of the sound speed grids. Required.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose {\-V}
Print the version. Repeat for debugging output.
.TP
.B \-\-woa-version=18|23
World Ocean Atlas edition of the grid. Required.

.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 if any position or the run failed, 9 for wrong usage and 130 after an
interrupt.

.SH EXAMPLES
Extract WOA23 decav profiles at 1 degree for the sites of a file:
.br
	mbsvpextract -I sites.ste -S woa_data --woa-version=23 -P decav -R 01 -O profiles

Extract WOA18 A5B7 profiles at 0.25 degree for the waypoints of a route, with both formulas:
.br
	mbsvpextract -I route.rte -S woa_data --woa-version=18 -P A5B7 -R 04 --formula=both -O profiles

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmbgrdviz\fP(1), \fBmblevitus\fP(1), \fBmbprocess\fP(1), \fBmbsvpbest\fP(1),
